@startuml
title ParkChoiceSG - Initial Use-Case Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Anonymous Driver" as Driver
actor "Parking Data Provider" as ParkingProvider
actor "Destination / Map /\nRouting Provider" as MapProvider
actor "Device Operating System" as OS

rectangle "ParkChoiceSG" {
  usecase "UC-01\nRequest Carpark\nRecommendation" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02\nInspect Carpark\nInformation" as UC02
  usecase "UC-03\nOpen External\nNavigation" as UC03
}

Driver -- UC01
Driver -- UC02
Driver -- UC03

ParkingProvider -- UC01
MapProvider -- UC01
MapProvider -- UC03
OS -- UC03

UC02 ..> UC01 : <<extend>>\nresult selected
UC03 ..> UC02 : <<extend>>\nnavigation requested

note bottom of UC01
  Current reported availability only.
  Fixed Best Overall score compares
  availability, estimated cost and
  walking distance. Up to five results.
end note
@enduml
